:* Prior to participating in this Quest, players **must fulfill the requirements** listed below.

=2 Preparation
* The player must have entered {p:Walk of Echoes} via the **Veridical Conflux** in {z:Xarcabard (S)} at (H-9) at least once.
** You will need to be on or past the {p:WotG} mission {p:Cait Sith|Cait Sith (Mission)} to do this.

* Complete each starting city's {p:Voidwatch} climb by defeating each of the 4 Stratum Abyssite tiers' NMs, and obtain the title from the Boss NM for that path. To do so, first you'll have to obtain the initial starter-city Abyssites from {p:Voidwatch Officers|Voidwatch Officer} in their respective cities:
** **{c=red:Note:}** Be sure to return to any {p:Atmacite Refiner} to analyze and upgrade Abyssite after defeating the monster(s) for each tier below.
** It may be beneficial for your time to purchase a stack of x99 {@i:Phase Displacer|3853} {i:Phase Displacers|Phase Displacer|3853} if you have {@k} {k:"Rhapsody in Mauve"}. These greatly weaken Voidwatch monster's HP and overall strength. With trusts they are not needed on anything lower than Tier IIIs for this first quest and fights, however, you will find them useful to have later on.

