=2 Walkthrough
=3 Further Preparations:
In order to flag {p:Cait Sith|Cait Sith (Mission)} which in turn enables the 2 **Veridical Conflux** mentioned below, you will need to complete any 4 past National Quests (no mix and matching allowed) of the following:
* {@g:San d'Oria} - **San d'Oria (S)**: {p:Knights of The Iron Ram} > {q:Steamed Rams|Steamed Rams|Steamed Rams} > {q:Gifts of the Griffon|Gifts of the Griffon|Gifts of the Griffon} > {q:Claws of the Griffon|Claws of the Griffon|Claws of the Griffon}.
* {@g:Bastok} - **Bastok (S)**: {p:Republican Legion's Fourth Divison} > {q:The Fighting Fourth|The Fighting Fourth|The Fighting Fourth} > {q:Better Part of Valor|Better Part of Valor|Better Part of Valor} > {q:Fires of Discontent|Fires of Discontent|Fires of Discontent}.
* {@g:Windurst} - **Windurst (S)**: {p:The Cobras} > {q:Snake on the Plains|Snake on the Plains|Snake on the Plains} > {q:The Tigress Stirs|The Tigress Stirs|The Tigress Stirs} > {q:The Tigress Strikes|The Tigress Strikes|The Tigress Strikes}.

Once a single Quest-line has been completed, touch any of the 3 {p:Cavernous Maws|Cavernous Maw} outside {p:Jeuno} **in the past** to get a cutscene for {p:Cait Sith (Mission)}. You will receive the title "__Cait Sith's Assistant__" when it finishes.
* **{c=red:Note:}** Present day {p:Maws|Cavernous Maw} surrounding {p:Jeuno} can also be used, provided you have unlocked them beforehand.
** If you have not unlocked these Maws, your only present-day option is the randomly-generated zone that you first landed into during the previous {p:mission|Cavernous Maws (Mission)}.

Now you will need to travel to {z:Xarcabard (S)}. You can reach it from this pathway:
* {z:Batallia Downs (S)} > {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} > {z:Xarcabard (S)}.
** The campaign warp to {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} places you near the survival guide if you're missing it.
*** Note that campaign warps are unlocked for each map that you've entered before.
*** Warping to {z:Batallia Downs} and using the maw to reach {z:Batallia Downs (S)} puts you near the zone line for {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} if you've never entered the zone before.
** Be sure to collect the {p:Survival Guide} in {z:Beaucedine Glacier (S)} and the {p:Home Point} in {z:Xarcabard (S)}.
* Once in {z:Xarcabard (S)} find the **Veridical Conflux** located near the {p:Home Point} for a cutscene and to acquire {@k} {k:Kupofried's medallion}.
** **{c=red:Note:}** if you try to skip this step you **will** have to return here.

Now travel to {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} and click on the **Veridical Conflux** located near the {k:Pashhow Gate Crystal|Pashhow gate crystal} in (J-9) to start a cutscene.
* {s:Recall-Pashh} or the nearby {p:Survival Guide} are both convenient options to get here.

After you receive the cutscene in {z:Pashhow Marshlands (S)} speak with a {p:Voidwatch Officer} in one of the three starting-Nations (past or present) to receive the {@k} {k:Voidwatch alarum}.
* **{c=red:Note:}** Do not forget the above step, it **cannot be done** at {p:Jeuno} or at any other external-cities {p:Voidwatch Officer}!

The Quest is now completed, and the next Quest {q:Drafted by the Duchy|Drafted by the Duchy|Drafted by the Duchy} is **finally** flagged.
